  "bodyHash": "c0d14a1fe105dd28",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_af23e6b2-20cf-42ed-a617-82e7f9382476.png\" alt=\"magichem main logo\" width=\"600\" height=\"375\"></p>\n<p>拓展你的奥术研究，解锁炼金术的秘密，体验<strong>MagiChem</strong>——这是<strong>Mana and Artifice</strong>的一个扩展模组，灵感来源于<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/alchemistry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Alchemistry</a>和MineChem，但带有独特的巫师风格。</p>\n<p><em>需要</em> Mana and Artifice（以及其依赖项 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/curios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Curios</a> 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GeckoLib</a>）。</p>\n<p><strong>整合包作者</strong>：请查阅<a href=\"https://github.com/AranaiRa/MagiChem/wiki\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">文档维基</a>，了解如何使用MagiChem的配方类型为你的整合包添加自定义内容！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\">利用物质解锁新的合成配方</h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_7db57630-84f1-429d-af77-a31a75456cde.png\" alt=\"a wizardly nook with several jars filled with colorful substances. some of the jars have labels that show a symbol.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>物质（Materia）是构成你Minecraft世界中一切事物的基本本质。使用受现实世界炼金术文献启发的工艺，将物品分解为其基础组件，然后将它们组合起来制造游戏中的几乎所有资源。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_d4c69caa-ff93-41cf-8c6e-fb900d921706.png\" alt=\"a strange device is pulling streams of colored fluid out of nearby jars and into a floating crystal. a large geometric magic circle floats above.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>或者，将物质和经验注入物品中，创造魔法神器，助力你的冒险之旅。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">成为早期的炼金术士</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_ae471465-fae4-4625-b1b0-d864c34f94cd.png\" alt=\"the player is using a bottle of metal-colored substance on an anvil. there is a cloud of grey smoke emanating from the anvil.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>MagiChem在你对Minecraft冒险的开始阶段到最终阶段的漫长旅程中都非常有用。解锁便捷配方，让你的第一个夜晚更轻松，例如修理铁砧或将泥土转化为草方块或菌丝体。</p>\n<p>随着你在Mana and Artifice中的进展，你将解锁更强大的技术和物品，这些足以媲美大师级炼金术士。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">建造魔法机器与诡秘工厂</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_0b9fe913-f415-4a74-97d6-a9fe3f5b1bdf.png\" alt=\"a small lab contains an alembic, a more advanced alembic made of electrum and tan stone, and a third device slightly offscreen with a large cogwheel. A stone construct stands ready to sort materia from the devices into nearby vessels.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>从你朴素的蒸馏器开始，你可以逐步升级至复杂的奥术装置，完美契合Mana and Artifice的美学风格。MagiChem通过新增任务扩展了Mana and Artifice的构造系统，让你无需依赖外部模组即可自动化复杂的工厂。无需管道或电线。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_cfa16baf-f276-4785-91a6-598ac6dd6a89.png\" alt=\"an enormous device with five giant tanks and a magic circle in the center sits in the middle of a room. there are four smaller, elementally-associated devices plugged into its corners.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>你还可以用强大的元素插件升级你的机器，使其效率更高。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">将红石技术提升至三维空间</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_0b63a7f8-1741-4ce8-9fbb-aedb47a4054a.png\" alt=\"a strange device that resembles a tuning fork attached to a red crystal hovers over a lever. to the right, a second tuning fork-like device (this one with a ring attached) is attached to a long string of red crystals hovering in midair, eventually powering a redstone lamp.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>将你的红石粉转变为信号石（Signalite），灵感来自<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/automagy\" rel=\"nofollow\">Automagy</a>中的红水晶。在三维空间中堆叠它，并精确控制方向输出以构建紧凑的机器。用“谎言混合剂”泼洒它，使其完全隐形，让你能在众目睽睽之下隐藏红石线路。最终，你可以制作出诸如随机数生成器和无线红石信号等奇迹，后者可以在同一维度内的任何地方接收信号！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">Mana and Artifice的新选项</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_6ca61449-32de-4412-8e93-e12fc49addc6.png\" alt=\"a ritual shaped like the symbol for the astrological sign Libra is on the ground in a ruined fortress. everything is lit up and colorful substances are being pulled out from two nearby jars.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>MagiChem为Mana and Artifice解锁了新物品、仪式和功能，让你能够无缝地将它融入你的魔法研究中。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/982204/description_d5cc5073-eb35-4b47-9212-94cd99ada1ac.png\" alt=\"a construct pushes a rotary device to generate power. to the right, pools set around a chalk-drawn magic circle release colorful gas as a mote is being crafted.\" width=\"600\" height=\"300\"></p>\n<p>发现通过炼金合成生成元素微粒的新方法。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>未来还将有更多更新，如法术、阵营专属配方，以及用构造体最喜欢的原料——炼金废料制作的可口零食！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">兼容流行模组</h2>\n<p>MagiChem开箱即用地支持其他流行模组，让你解锁新的进阶路径。以下模组已内置配方和/或兼容物品，未来还将支持更多：</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/botania\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> &mdash; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/hexerei\" rel=\"nofollow\">Hexerei</a> &mdash; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/occultism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Occultism</a> &mdash; <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/supplementaries\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Supplementaries</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>MagiChem仍在积极开发中，新功能不断加入，因此请查看你的奥术法典（Codex Arcana）的新章节以了解更多。谁知道你会揭开什么秘密呢。</p>",
